{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1142317-how-difficult-is-astroturfing-to-connect-to-pentex","id":1142317,"title":"How difficult is Astroturfing to connect to Pentex?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-20T15:23:13-07:00","id":1142317,"title":"How difficult is Astroturfing to connect to Pentex?","content":"<br /> Was thinking for a bit, ideas what kind of opposed rolls might be involve in trying to find a link between pentex and a group of astroturfers?<br /> <br /> Edit: Oh! For those not as Savvy as me , Astro turfing references any form of fake grass roots movement... trying to make it look like its coming from &quot;the little people&quot; rather then a governmental or corporate entity.<br /> <br /> Its, last I checked, not illegal, probaly because of how diff icult it is to prove or disprove.<br /> <br /> as for what im asking all I want is enough proof to make a reasonable person suspicious.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user"