{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-20T20:24:03-07:00","id":1142395,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1142317-how-difficult-is-astroturfing-to-connect-to-pentex?p=1142380#post1142380\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sounds interesting seen some alleged cases of astroturfing IRL<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> and believed the accusation when I saw enough evidence.<br /> <br /> or is the reason I looked because im a liberal?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> What have you done with the knowledge that something is Astroturfed? Convincing one or two people something is astroturfed isn't really the issue its convincing people to act against the group for astroturfing. Getting major media to acknowledge its astroturfing vs just taking money for adds by the parent company(or is bought out entirely)<br /> <br /> OF course in magical werewolf world you have gifts and can attack spiritual representations of such, call various spirits of truth(or deception) to make a protest seem more or less respected...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-21T05:51:25-07:00","id":1142475,"title":"","content":"Ive concluded the accusation of Astroturfing was real, then again many of the cases Ive heard of were years old.<br /> <br /> but your right ive done nothing beyond spreading it on facebook.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-21T07:43:37-07:00","id":1142503,"title":"","content":"It would exceptionally easy for an organization like Pentex to engage in some form of astroturfing. I don't think that they wouldn't even do it as an organization, but a subsidiary of Pentex would likely fund some other organization which would then fund other groups that could be a mix of concerned activists and paid agents.<br /> <br /> Personally, I wouldn't have any rolls involved. I think that this could could be role played and have players investigate things. I think it all depends on what kind of astroturf group you want to show in your game, how their activities serve Pentex, and how you want you your players to interact with them. Well done astroturfing should piggyback on or encourage real activists. Also, Pentex could also reverse things by funding activists who are too extreme and make a position they disagree with look bad. For example, maybe Pentex could fund some radical ecoterrorists who make environmentalists look bad. There are all sorts of interesting possibilities that could be explored here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-21T08:09:03-07:00","id":1142522,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1142317-how-difficult-is-astroturfing-to-connect-to-pentex?p=1142380#post1142380\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">or is the reason I looked because im a liberal?</div> </div> </div> </div>Unlikely. It's not a phenomenon limited to one part of the political spectrum. Sometimes it's not even politically motivated. Being a liberal might affect where you see it first, but that's about it.<br /> <br /> As far as Pentex goes, I completely believe they use astroturfing. But more than that I think they do the reverse. That is, they use fake nonprofits to hire fake protesters to join their opponents. Then they can either accuse their opponents of astroturfing or have the fake protesters misbehave to have the entire protest discredited. And yes, both of these techniques are used in real life.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-21T09:23:01-07:00","id":1142555,"title":"","content":"not surprised.<br /> <br /> what kinds of rolls do you think would be involved in finding evidence of astroturfing... and bringing it into the light?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-25T11:56:25-07:00","id":1143855,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1142317-how-difficult-is-astroturfing-to-connect-to-pentex?p=1142555#post1142555\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">not surprised.<br /> <br /> what kinds of rolls do you think would be involved in finding evidence of astroturfing... and bringing it into the light?</div> </div> </div> </div>Two tactics I can think of. The first is the standard form of following the money from Pentex, through its various shell corporations, and to groups that end up protesting for it. The second is to follow likely paid protesters and tracking the money back to Pentex, then you have the same issue of finding the proper communications. Once you have the connection you have to find communication or testimony to prove it is intentional and not just accidental. So I see a mix of Investigation, Intimidation, Computers and the like.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-25T12:06:29-07:00","id":1143859,"title":"","content":"'Intentional and not just accidental'<br /> <br /> You mean find proof Pentex is Organizing the protest, not happening to aid protestors whos goals it finds amenable to its own?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-25T12:14:34-07:00","id":1143861,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1142317-how-difficult-is-astroturfing-to-connect-to-pentex?p=1143859#post1143859\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">'Intentional and not just accidental'<br /> <br /> You mean find proof Pentex is Organizing the protest, not happening to aid protestors whos goals it finds amenable to its own?</div> </div> </div> </div>That or proof that it is specifically requesting that someone organize the fake protesters. Otherwise it could just claim it was funding groups it thought were legitimate and never realized those groups were wasting the money in shameful and unethical ways.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-25T13:01:21-07:00","id":1143874,"title":"","content":"I don't think PENTEX has a need for independent astroturf groups. They can just contribute through its subsidiaries to existing such groups and utilize them when needed. When needed, they can then exercise control indirectly so that the group does what they need them to do. In all except a few instances, there is nothing they can't do with a more generic astroturf group (often supported by industry associations rather than directly by a corporation) than one they set up themselves. The benefit is that it is not directly linked back to them, but at the cost the group is not completely controlled by them. But I don't think that is a major issue. Astroturf groups are mainly there to send letters to the editors or politicians, or arrange media events. They are not very deep. Direct PENTEX control would be for assets that are much strongly skilled and require discretion in their use.<br /> <br /> Regardless of how the astroturf group is portrayed, it is just a case of following the money. Extended rolls in Finance, Politics, Law. or Investigation might do it. Determine the total number of successes needed based on how many intermediaries are between PENTEX and the group (probably between 10-15 successes). Then have one roll per month, or financial quarter, or similar. Set the difficulty between 6-8. The number of successes needed, frequency of rolls, and difficulty should be based on how long you'd hope for this plot to run. If you want this resolved quickly, make them on the low end. If you want a prolonged mystery over many game sessions, put them on the high end.<br /> <br /> If you want something more than simply dice rolls, then you can say once a certain # of successes are reached (say 5), that the trail ends at location X. To continue, the PCs need to recover an additional clue through an adventure. Then once that is completed, they can continue with the next series of die rolls and required successes. Repeat as often as you need.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-25T18:11:47-07:00","id":1143929,"title":"","content":"Ideas on Supernaturals that could be involved? <br /> <br /> Somehow I doubt even a rank 1 is going to stoop to being part of any but the most remarkable of cases of astroturfing.<br /> <br /> Hmmmn Toads? Ferectoi?<br /> <br /> The &quot;Were Frogs&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-25T19:27:36-07:00","id":1143944,"title":"","content":"Why would supernaturals need to be involved in a fake grass roots activism? At most, someone way up top deciding how it is to be used. PENTEX likely utilizes a Toad or other &quot;middle management fomori.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-25T20:03:26-07:00","id":1143953,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1142317-how-difficult-is-astroturfing-to-connect-to-pentex?p=1143929#post1143929\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Ideas on Supernaturals that could be involved?<br /> <br /> Somehow I doubt even a rank 1 is going to stoop to being part of any but the most remarkable of cases of astroturfing.<br /> <br /> Hmmmn Toads? Ferectoi?<br /> <br /> The &quot;Were Frogs&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Honestly how do you want to engage the situation? What is the purpose of the Astroturfing both in universe and narratively as part of the story. That's really how close you'd get to a supernatural I mean a vampire who wants to change parts of the city and is using their influence among a group to create fake protests probably would imbed a ghoul somewhere in the situation to see things working out. There's also dealing with the spiritual reflection of false protests or the presence of banes that could transform a relatively peaceful protest into a violent one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T04:42:12-07:00","id":1144022,"title":"","content":"Also, who are you proving astroturfing to? What you need changes a lot depending on if they are regular people or supernatural and if you are trying to convince legal authorities or just sway public opinion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T12:26:55-07:00","id":1144513,"title":"","content":"im thinking sway public opinion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T13:18:21-07:00","id":1144522,"title":"","content":"In the real world, you'd for U.S. entities that are not-for-profits, they'd have to file a form 990 tax return. This is a tax return for not-for-profits and while they pay no tax, it does provide some financial reporting information like revenues and names of officers. If any U.S. entity receives substantial federal grant funding, $750,000 or more I last time I checked, then they must file an audit report in compliance with the Single Audit Act. While these reports can be less than honest in their presentation, there would be evidence of some basic information on various not-for-profits.<br /> <br /> Oh, and the stuff used to replace grass is an abomination on a baseball field and if painted blue and orange on a football field. I was first thinking of Pentex planting artificial grass, but the term astroturfing makes a lot of sense. A grass roots movement is much easier to infiltrate and control if you create a fake grass roots group. I could see every supernatural group doing that, because they don't want to be noticed yet want to exert power. It's always good to have some catspaws.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-28T21:35:07-07:00","id":1145092,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1142317-how-difficult-is-astroturfing-to-connect-to-pentex?p=1144513#post1144513\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">im thinking sway public opinion.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> What are you trying to get them to sway public opinion on? Clearing a local forest that happens to have the Caern? That local mine is &quot;the only source of jobs&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}